{"_id":"6a2ff98f2204ffbc59e5a789","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"7XHYCVpUpvwAtaUBjTa4O","description":"# Cross-tabulation\n\nCross-tabulation (crosstab) counts the frequency of combinations of values across two or more categorical variables. `pd.crosstab()` produces a table of frequencies or proportions. It is used to examine relationships between categorical variables, such as how customer segments differ across product categories.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"pandas.crosstab","url":"https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.crosstab.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeaf6"},{"type":"article","title":"The Power of Crosstab Function in Pandas","url":"https://medium.com/geekculture/the-power-of-crosstab-function-in-pandas-for-data-analysis-and-visualization-6c085c269fcd","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeaf7"},{"type":"video","title":"Python Pandas Tutorial 13. Crosstab","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I_kUj-MfYys","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeaf8"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T13:09:35.582Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/7XHYCVpUpvwAtaUBjTa4O.md"}